  "about": "Envelope #12 of docs/share-a-server.md: only an admin device of the joining account accepts a share. Every platform must build each envelope's canonical string from `fields` and reproduce the Ed25519 signature with the named signer (adminRoot = Ed25519 seed adminRootSeedHex, irk = the protocol IRK of memberUmkSeedHex, member = deriveShareMemberKey(memberUmk, shareId)); refuse every `refuse` case; fail to verify every `reject` case against the named public key; and parse `payload` (the sealed acceptance's plaintext) keeping its `admin` proof. `attestation` is `.com`'s CA-signed AccountKeyAttestation (CA = Ed25519 seed caSeedHex); only TS and the box check it, the apps carry it unchanged.",
